sequenceDiagram
    participant Router as llm-d Router<br/>(Scheduling Layer)
    participant VLLMServer as vLLM Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant ConfigPlugin as ServerConfigPlugin
    participant DevicesPlugin as ServerDevicesPlugin
    participant KVCachePlugin as ServerKVCachePlugin
    participant AppState as app.state<br/>(Cached Responses)
    participant EngineClient as vLLM EngineClient
    participant Worker as vLLM Worker<br/>(DeviceInfoWorkerExtension)
    participant GPU as GPU Platform<br/>(current_platform)

    Note over VLLMServer,GPU: Startup Phase (one-time initialization)

    VLLMServer->>ConfigPlugin: init_state(vllm_config)
    ConfigPlugin->>ConfigPlugin: Build config from VllmConfig<br/>(model, scheduler, parallelism,<br/>KV transfer settings)
    ConfigPlugin->>ConfigPlugin: Redact kv_connector_extra_config<br/>(unless EXPOSE env=1)
    ConfigPlugin->>AppState: Cache config response

    VLLMServer->>DevicesPlugin: init_state(vllm_config)
    DevicesPlugin->>EngineClient: collective_rpc("get_device_properties")
    EngineClient->>Worker: collective_rpc dispatch
    Worker->>GPU: Query device properties<br/>(name, memory, compute capability)
    GPU-->>Worker: DeviceProperties
    Worker-->>EngineClient: Per-rank device info
    EngineClient-->>DevicesPlugin: Device properties list
    DevicesPlugin->>AppState: Cache devices response

    VLLMServer->>KVCachePlugin: init_state(vllm_config)
    KVCachePlugin->>EngineClient: get_kv_cache_spec()
    EngineClient-->>KVCachePlugin: KV cache capacity
    alt vLLM supports group metadata
        KVCachePlugin->>EngineClient: get_kv_cache_group_metadata()
        EngineClient-->>KVCachePlugin: Attention group specs<br/>(full, MLA, sliding window, etc.)
    else Older vLLM build
        Note over KVCachePlugin: Feature-detect via hasattr<br/>Fall back to capacity-only
    end
    KVCachePlugin->>AppState: Cache KV cache response

    Note over Router,AppState: Runtime Phase (cached responses)

    Router->>VLLMServer: GET /plugins/llm-d-server-introspection/config
    VLLMServer->>ConfigPlugin: Route request
    ConfigPlugin->>AppState: Read cached response
    AppState-->>ConfigPlugin: ServerConfigResponse
    ConfigPlugin-->>VLLMServer: 200 OK (JSON)
    VLLMServer-->>Router: Config data

    Router->>VLLMServer: GET /plugins/llm-d-server-introspection/devices
    VLLMServer->>DevicesPlugin: Route request
    DevicesPlugin->>AppState: Read cached response
    AppState-->>DevicesPlugin: ServerDevicesResponse
    DevicesPlugin-->>VLLMServer: 200 OK (JSON)
    VLLMServer-->>Router: Device properties

    Router->>VLLMServer: GET /plugins/llm-d-server-introspection/kv-cache
    VLLMServer->>KVCachePlugin: Route request
    KVCachePlugin->>AppState: Read cached response
    AppState-->>KVCachePlugin: ServerKVCacheResponse
    KVCachePlugin-->>VLLMServer: 200 OK (JSON)
    VLLMServer-->>Router: KV cache capacity & groups

    Note over DevicesPlugin,KVCachePlugin: On missing engine: HTTP 503<br/>On missing init: HTTP 500
